+# The end-to-end world: three questions (one per partition) x two repetitions, keys named (question index, repetition).
+# Every record is a copy of one fixture template: R = submitted and right, W = submitted and wrong, C = capped, no output.
+ORIGINALS = {(0, 0): "R", (0, 1): "W", (1, 0): "C", (1, 1): "W", (2, 0): "W", (2, 1): "C"}
+# The fold: question 0 in both repetitions, question 1 in repetition 0 only (its repetition 1 is copied, a mixed-source
+# question), question 2 never (neither repetition). The re-run record of each folded key:
+RERUNS = {(0, 0): "W", (0, 1): "R", (1, 0): "R"}
